    rdfs:label "is domestic"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Trust satisfies domestic trust tests under IRC §7701(a)(30)"@en .

###  http://example.org/trust-domain#hasEIN
:hasEIN rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
